   "key": "func SpeechInputManager.stop()",
   "hash": "47771e0241ecfc85",
   "does": "Async. If recording and no stop is already waiting: stops capture (stopCapture), then waits until the recognizer's final result or an error arrives (handleRecognition) or finalResultTimeout passes (scheduleFinalResultTimeout), so the last words are in transcript; then clears isRecording and returns transcript. isRecording stays true while it waits. Otherwise returns the transcript so far at once. Discardable result.",
